 "_note": "DRIVE-S81-SLICEP 10-20: landed parent of the MU die master dsdv_slice_lepe_mu (mu7v2u). Same recipe as dsdv_slice_lepe_nh (S81-LEPENH2/DRIVE-S81-LEPENH): regions S = slice cluster u_sl, K = MU endpoint u_lep + MU landing leaf u_land + 2 lane tiles; the S<->K crossings (line ro/ri 1104 b each way, slice fault) land once each in fixed-latency rings (D 4 / E 2, chunk 8, kept-enable writers, per-chunk reset forest); slice->lep->slice is a cross-region loop -> RESCHEDULE (+3 edges on the off-die line hop, elastic at the d2d link layer). mu_c/mu_rc/mu_rt and the host plane are region K ports. E end (s_7N), host plane.",
 "_note_bench": "lockstep tb_stimulus not built yet (lepe_nh loopback vh is port-specific); bind + gate first (DRIVE-S81-SLICEP)."
